#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/advice.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Batteries replaced too often: {first} d then {second} d (under 30 d)"
msgstr ""
"Batterie sostituite troppo spesso: {first} g, poi {second} g (meno di 30 g)"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/advice.rs
msgid ""
"Check the declared chemistry ([battery] chemistry), try fresh cells of "
"another batch or low self-discharge NiMH cells, and switch the keyboard off "
"when it is not used."
msgstr ""
"Controlla la chimica dichiarata ([battery] chemistry), prova batterie nuove "
"di un altro lotto o NiMH a bassa autoscarica, e spegni la tastiera quando "
"non la usi."

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/alias.rs
#, rust-format
